        "source": "kg"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_2",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Amélie Simone Mauresmo ] (born 5 July 1979) is a French former professional tennis player, and a former world No. 1. Mauresmo won two Grand Slam singles titles at the Australian Open and at Wimbledon, and also won a Silver Medal at the 2004 Summer Olympics.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999960309688,
